## Usage

`TxPixelField` renders a zero-dependency Canvas 2D square-pixel particle lattice. At rest, particles breathe gently with floating edge spores; hovering tightens the silhouette, adds 3D depth parallax, blooms vein highlights, and reacts smoothly to pointer motion and click pulses.

### Feature cards grid (botanical presets)

Use the four built-in botanical presets (`branch`, `leaf`, `sprout`, `blade`) with `stage="obsidian"` and default slot overlays to compose high-contrast showcase cards, or switch to `adaptive` for native light and dark theme pairing.

:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="PixelFieldVioletCardsDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import { TxPixelField } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/pixel-field'
  </script>

  <template>
    <TxPixelField preset="leaf" palette="emerald" stage="obsidian" interaction="coalesce">
      <div class="feature-overlay">
        <h4>Visual Continuity</h4>
        <p>From ideas to experiences</p>
      </div>
    </TxPixelField>
  </template>
---
:::

### Geometric presets and custom text sampling

Alongside botanical forms, `TxPixelField` ships `orb` and `wave` geometric presets and can sample any custom `text` or `src` image/SVG into the same interactive particle matrix.

:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="PixelFieldPlaygroundDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import { TxPixelField } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/pixel-field'
  </script>

  <template>
    <TxPixelField text="TUFF" palette="cyan" stage="obsidian" interaction="repel" />
  </template>
---
:::

### Best Practices

- Keep decorative slot chrome non-blocking (`pointer-events: none` on passive copy containers) so pointer motion reaches the particle stage smoothly.
- Use the default `stage="adaptive"` for pages that follow light/dark themes; reserve `stage="obsidian"` for dedicated dark showcase cards.
- External `src` images require CORS headers so offscreen canvas sampling can read pixel luminance.
- Keep `density` between `0.8` and `1.2` when rendering multi-card grids for crisp detail at steady 60fps.

## API Reference

### Props

| Name | Type | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `preset` | `'branch' \| 'leaf' \| 'sprout' \| 'blade' \| 'orb' \| 'wave'` | `'leaf'` | Built-in procedural botanical or geometric field preset. |
| `src` | `string` | — | Custom image or SVG URL sampled by luminance and edge gradient (highest priority). |
| `text` | `string` | — | Custom glyph or wordmark rasterized into an interactive pixel lattice. |
| `palette` | `'emerald' \| 'violet' \| 'cyan' \| 'amber' \| 'mono' \| PixelFieldPalette` | `'emerald'` | Built-in four-stop bioluminescent/mineral palette or custom colour ramp. |
| `stage` | `'adaptive' \| 'obsidian'` | `'adaptive'` | `adaptive` follows `--tx-*` light/dark tokens; `obsidian` locks a pitch-black showcase stage. |
| `pixelSize` | `number` | `3` | Base square dot size in CSS pixels. |
| `gap` | `number` | `1.6` | Lattice cell spacing in CSS pixels. |
| `density` | `number` | `1` | Lattice density multiplier (`0.4–1.6`). |
| `speed` | `number` | `1` | Ambient breathing and shimmer speed multiplier (`0.2–3`). |
| `animated` | `boolean` | `true` | Enables continuous ambient motion. |
| `paused` | `boolean` | `false` | Freezes rendering on the current frame. |
| `interactive` | `boolean` | `true` | Enables hover parallax, silhouette coalescing, and local pointer physics. |
| `interaction` | `'coalesce' \| 'repel' \| 'attract' \| 'ripple'` | `'coalesce'` | Pointer physics mode. |
| `pointerRadius` | `number` | `96` | Pointer force influence radius in CSS pixels. |
| `pointerStrength` | `number` | `1` | Pointer force intensity multiplier (`0–2`). |
| `parallax` | `number` | `1` | Depth parallax sway multiplier on hover (`0–2`). |
| `rippleOnClick` | `boolean` | `true` | Emits an expanding luminous shockwave ring on click. |
| `aspectRatio` | `string \| number` | — | Optional CSS aspect ratio for the container. |
| `radius` | `number \| string` | `20` | Container corner radius. |
| `ariaLabel` | `string` | `labels.stage` | Accessible canvas description. |
| `labels` | `Partial<PixelFieldLabels>` | English defaults | Fallback assistive labels. |

### Events

| Event | Payload | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `pulse` | `{ nx: number; ny: number }` | Fired when a click or imperative `pulse()` launches a shockwave (normalized `0–1`). |

### Slots

| Slot | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `default` | Foreground overlay content (titles, indices, badges) layered above the pixel canvas. |

### Exposed Methods

| Method | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `pulse(nx?, ny?)` | Triggers an expanding luminous ripple at normalized coordinates (defaults to center). |
| `rebuild()` | Re-samples the particle lattice for the current bounds and props. |
| `count` | Read-only count of active particles in the lattice. |

### CSS Variables

| Variable | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `--tx-pixel-field-radius` | `20px` | Stage border radius. |
| `--tx-pixel-field-bg` | `--tx-bg-color-overlay` | Background fill in `adaptive` mode. |
| `--tx-pixel-field-border` | `--tx-border-color` | Inset ring colour in `adaptive` mode. |
| `--tx-pixel-field-obsidian-bg` | `#040506` | Pitch-black stage fill in `obsidian` mode. |

## Overview

- Integrated with the shared `useMotionActivity` boundary so offscreen, hidden, KeepAlive-deactivated, or reduced-motion hosts halt the rAF loop while keeping a sharp static frame.
- Uses a pre-baked 64-step colour LUT and DPR-snapped `fillRect` passes with zero per-frame allocations and no browser WebGL context cap across multi-card grids.
- Deterministic hash seeding guarantees reproducible silhouettes for consistent visual regression testing.

## Technologies

- Custom Canvas 2D deterministic pixel-matrix engine combining botanical vein distance fields, offscreen Sobel edge sampling, damped spring particle physics, and a 64-step colour LUT.
- Source path: `packages/tuffex/packages/components/src/pixel-field/`.

